const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A four-petalled flower stands in the middle, its two long petals level and its two short ones upright. Each petal is a round body with a tip lobe and two shoulders between ruled seams. Four broad curled bands surround it in place of the quince's lobes: a long shallow band above and below, and a deeper band at each side. Each band is the space between two circles about one centre, and each end swells into a round bulb that rolls in towards the flower.","ja":"中央に四枚の花びらの花を、長い二枚を横に、短い二枚を縦にして置きます。花びらはどれも、直線の境の間に、丸い胴と、先と両肩の三つのふくらみを作ります。そのまわりを、木瓜の外の形の代わりに、幅の広い巻き端の帯四本で囲みます。上下には長く浅い帯、左右には深い帯を置きます。帯はどれも、中心が同じ二つの円の間の形で、両端は丸くふくらんで花の方へ巻き込みます。"};

